","upstream":"# Zen Stable Release\n\n\n## Security\n- https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/security/advisories/mfsa2026-130/\n\n## New Features\n- Updated to Firefox 160.0.1\n- The copy URL and copy URL as Markdown shortcuts now copy the URLs of all selected tabs when multiple tabs are selected.\n\n## Fixes\n- Fixed boosts color tinting and controls not working. ([#16586](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/16586))\n- Fixed closed browser and popup windows never being freed from memory, which made memory usage and pauses grow over time. ([#16587](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/16587))\n- Switching spaces is now smooth when spaces use gradient themes, instead of being choppy. ([#13029](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/13029))\n- Fixed tabs shown in a split view or behind a glance being unloaded when memory runs low. ([#16624](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/16624))\n- Fixed Spaces Sync for spaces and pinned tabs assigned to the built-in containers (Personal, Work, Banking, Shopping) on profiles that don't have them. Missing containers are now created when needed. ([#16614](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/16614))\n- Fixed the copy URL shortcut copying \"about:blank\" while a page is still loading. ([#16510](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/16510))\n- Improved performance when opening new windows with mods installed. ([#16674](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/16674))\n- Fixed thin lines in PDFs printing as thick black boxes on some printers on Windows.\n- Fixed PDFs, web page graphics, and WebGL content appearing blank or broken on Macs with AMD graphics, such as black cells in Google Sheets.\n- Fixed incorrect colors in WebGL and canvas content, such as games and Google Meet backgrounds, on some Linux systems using Wayland.\n- Fixed links on some sites, such as the Google Store, taking a very long time to load.\n- Fixed tabs crashing on some sites, most notably ChatGPT.\n- Fixed WebTransport connections being unable to send datagrams after a site sent many in quick succession.\n- Fixed trackpad and mouse swipes sometimes scrolling the page when a site had blocked scrolling.\n- More bug fixes and improvements.\n\n## Changes\n- The zoom level button is now hidden in the single toolbar layout. A toast shows the current zoom level when you change it instead.\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/releases/tag/1.24.3b"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","DISPLAY=:1","PERL5LIB=/usr/local/bin","START_DOCKER=true","PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/defaults","SELKIES_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_input_interposer.so","SELKIES_WEBCAM_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_v4l2_interposer.so","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all","DISABLE_DRI3=false","SELKIES_ENCODER=h264enc,h265enc,vp8enc,vp9enc,av1enc,jpeg","SELKIES_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTH=false","SELKIES_VIDEO_STREAMING_MODE=false","SELKIES_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*","SELKIES_RATE_CONTROL_MODE=crf,cbr","SHELL=/bin/bash","__GL_SYNC_TO_VBLANK=0","TITLE=Zen","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","PIXELFLUX_WAYLAND=true"],"exposed_ports":["3000/tcp","3001/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.3b-ls14.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.3b-ls14/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.3b-ls14/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/zen/builds/1.24.3b-ls14/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-zen/releases/tag/1.24.3b-ls14","pages":"https://linuxserver-